{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "隼太", "steam": "隼太"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "隼太"}, "voice": {"chs": "ht0157", "steam": "ht0157", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「我说啊，真的好难啊！\\n　新吾新吾，你最后一道题做出来了吗？」", "steam": "「嘎啊，真的好難！新吾新吾，你最後一個問題有寫出來嗎？」"}, "length": {"chs": 32, "steam": 28}, "similarity": 0.511}
